# An Unexpected Party: "As this enchantment enters, choose a creature type. Creatures you control of the chosen type get
# +2/+2." Bot1 chooses Dwarf as it enters (paid exactly with a Black Lotus and a Mox Pearl): its Dwarven Provisioner (2/2) becomes
# 4/4, its Ornithopter (a Thopter) stays 0/2, and Bot2's Bastion Enforcer, also a Dwarf, stays 3/2 (CR 205.3m, 613.4c).

